    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      100.69,
      547.23,
      147.76
    ],
    "text": "02. The Mediation Boards Commission hereby gives notice Calling upon (a) the Individuals,(b) the Bodies,Organizations and Institutions of non political nature, and (c) the District Secretaries/ Divisional Secretaries specifiedhereinafter to submit names of person who are eligible for appointment as Mediators to the Panel of Mediators for thesaid Mediation Board areas:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      97.75,
      160.69,
      547.25,
      183.76
    ],
    "text": "(a) The following Individuals are entitled to submit nominations other than their own for appointment to thePanel of a particular Mediation Board area:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      122.95,
      196.69,
      547.19,
      231.76
    ],
    "text": "(i) a Public Officer or a Provincial Public Officer serving as the Head of a Department or as the LocalHead of a Department in an office located within the Administrative District in which that particularMediation Board area is situated:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      119.95,
      244.69,
      547.21,
      267.76
    ],
    "text": "(ii) the Head of a Place or religious worship or of a school situated in that particular Mediation Boardarea is situated;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      116.95,
      280.69,
      547.17,
      303.76
    ],
    "text": "(iii) a retired Head of a Department or a retired Head of a School residing in that particular MediationBoard area;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      118.75,
      316.69,
      274.75,
      327.76
    ],
    "text": "(iv) Chairman of Panel of Mediators.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      124.87,
      340.69,
      547.21,
      363.76
    ],
    "text": "(i) Anybody, Organizations or Institution which has been in existence for at least five years and which isengaged in carrying out or serving anyone or more of the under mentioned objectives;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      145.75,
      376.69,
      538.82,
      387.76
    ],
    "text": "(a) the promotion of educational, religious, moral or spiritual, advancement of the community;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      145.15,
      400.69,
      410.39,
      411.76
    ],
    "text": "(b) the promotion of social welfare and the relief from poverty;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      145.15,
      424.69,
      362.4,
      435.76
    ],
    "text": "(c) the promotion of rural community development;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      145.15,
      448.69,
      307.18,
      459.76
    ],
    "text": "(d) the promotion of culture of sports;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      145.15,
      472.69,
      547.16,
      495.76
    ],
    "text": "(e) the promotion of projects, programmes and activities intended to provide and supply basicneeds of the peoples such as health, food and shelter.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      97.15,
      508.69,
      547.2,
      531.76
    ],
    "text": "(c) The following District Secretaries/Divisional Secretaries are entitled to submit nominations for appointmentto the Panel of a particular Mediation Board Area:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      122.95,
      544.69,
      547.17,
      555.76
    ],
    "text": "(i) The District Secretary of the Administrative District in which that Mediation Board area is situated;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      119.95,
      568.69,
      547.19,
      591.76
    ],
    "text": "(ii) Persons who are entitled to be appointed to the Panel of a particular mediation area and whose namesmay be so submitted are \u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      145.75,
      604.69,
      478.79,
      615.76
    ],
    "text": "(a) any person resident in Mediation Board are engaged in any work in that area;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      145.15,
      628.69,
      547.16,
      651.76
    ],
    "text": "(b) any person resident or engaged in any work outside that Mediation Board area, if the Commissionso decides in exceptional circumstances; and",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      145.15,
      664.69,
      547.19,
      699.76
    ],
    "text": "(c) any Public Officer nominated by the District Secretary of the Administrative District withinwhich that Mediation Board is situated. An Officer so nominated is eligible for appointment tothe Panel of Mediators of every Mediation Board area within that Administrative District;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      145.87,
      712.69,
      547.23,
      735.76
    ],
    "text": "(d) the present Chairman of Panels of Mediators/Mediators who are completed three years in officeand are due to vacate post.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      47.01,
      71.17,
      537.81,
      94.38
    ],
    "text": "I fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2017'01'23PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 23.01.20173A",
    "fonts": [
      "FMAbabld,Bold",
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.300000190734863,
      9.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      82.65,
      100.69,
      537.92,
      147.76
    ],
    "text": "03. (a) Individual and Bodies, Organizations and Institutions referred to Para (02) above may not submitnominations of such persons as are specified in Para 2(a) and 2(b) above who are not Public Officers,They may, however, nominate Provincial Public Officer. An individual is not entitled to nominate himselfor herself.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      101.85,
      160.69,
      537.88,
      183.76
    ],
    "text": "(b) District Secretary referred to in Para 2(a) above may submit nominations of Public Officers of who notmore than five may be appointed by the Commission to the relevant Panel of Mediators.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      83.85,
      196.69,
      194.86,
      207.76
    ],
    "text": "04. Form of Nominations:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      99.45,
      220.69,
      406.67,
      231.76
    ],
    "text": "(a)Individuals should submit nomination substantially in Form (a) below;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      98.85,
      244.69,
      537.82,
      255.76
    ],
    "text": "(b)Bodies, Organizations and Institutions should submit nominations substantially in Form (b) below; and.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      98.85,
      268.69,
      537.85,
      279.76
    ],
    "text": "(c)District Secretaries, Divisional Secretaries should submit nominations substantially in Form (c) below;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      83.85,
      292.69,
      537.86,
      315.76
    ],
    "text": "Each nomination should be in a separate form and should without fail contain the recommendation of thenominator as indicated in the next Para.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      328.69,
      537.91,
      387.76
    ],
    "text": "05. The recommendation of the nominator should not be a mere recommendation without reasons. It should setout specific facts and circumstances to enable the Commission to draw its own reference to the suitability or otherwiseof the person nominated for appointment to the Panel of Mediators, such as, for instance, his or her person or pastoccupation, the period of service or engagement in such occupations, any position or trust or responsibility held by himor her and the office, if any, held by him or her in any social service/ religious/charitable Organization, Society or Body.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      400.69,
      537.99,
      435.76
    ],
    "text": "06. An individual or a Body, Organizations or Institution should as far as possible, refrain from making more thanthree nominations in respect of the same Mediation Board area. However, this limitation will not apply to the presentChairman of the Panel of Mediators and to the District Secretaries, and Divisional Secretaries.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      448.69,
      537.94,
      471.76
    ],
    "text": "All nominations should be forwarded to reach the Secretary, Mediation Board Commissions, No: 80, MinistryOf Justice\u2019s New Building, Courts Rd, Colombo 12. on or before 31st March 2017",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.800000190734863,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      484.69,
      537.84,
      507.76
    ],
    "text": "07. The Commission will initially select such eligible persons as are, in its view suitable to follow a preliminarytraining course in Mediators skills and techniques.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      410.49,
      532.69,
      537.21,
      567.76
    ],
    "text": "D.M. KARUNARATHNA,Secretary,Mediation Boards Commission.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      580.69,
      235.66,
      651.76
    ],
    "text": "Office of the Mediation Boards Commission,No : 80,Ministry Of Justice\u2019s New BuildingCourts Rd,Colombo 12.18th January 2017.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
